# FamilyLive Connect

This repository serves as the starter foundation for the FamilyLive Connect product.

It includes:
- monorepo structure
- production-grade design documents
- initial NestJS backend implementation
- template for later Flutter client app modules

## Folder layout

```text
apps/
  mobile/
    README.md
services/
  backend/
    src/
    package.json
    tsconfig.json
    tsconfig.build.json
    nest-cli.json
```
